# AIRA (Akash Intelligent Reactive Assistant) - Project Scaffolding Plan

The goal is to set up the foundation for the AIRA system based on your `project_desc.txt` and `readme.md`. This includes the "AI Brain" (Python FastAPI) and the "Execution Layer" (Python Device Agents), enforcing local-first AI through Ollama.

## Proposed Changes

We will scaffold two main components in `d:\learning\AIRA`: the `ai-engine` and the `agents` execution layer.

### 1. AI Engine (Python FastAPI)

This acts as the brain, processing natural language, interacting with vector memory, and routing structured intent to agents.

